  "knownFindings": [
    "OwnedTraceArtifactStore retained quotas are not a proven whole-root physical peak cap; release remains blocked until converter execution has an independent quota boundary.",
    "prepare_symbols advertises open-world policy conservatively, while this implementation intentionally fails remote resolution as unimplemented instead of silently performing network access.",
    "ADR 0005 release-stage defaults are a separate rollout gate; this inventory records both reachable profiles and does not declare which release may default to either."
  ]
